{"id":"bfb5c09fbdfe12e8","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-WKL.md","title":"Weak König Lemma","display":"df-WKL — Weak König Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-WKL","aliases":["62-df-WKL"],"display":"df-WKL — Weak König Lemma","depends_on":["[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.10.1; §IV.1","source_pages":[36,127],"source_pdf_pages":[54,145]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-WKL"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-WKL</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-WKL — Weak König Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.10.1; §IV.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>36</span><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span><span>145</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>树、路径与高度谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>，函数编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2=S_2\">\\(L_2=S_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)\\)</span> 在下式作为单个句子引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WKL}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\forall T\\bigl[(\\operatorname{BinTree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{UnboundedHeight}(T))\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\mathsf{Path}(T,f))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WKL}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\forall T\\bigl[(\\operatorname{BinTree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{UnboundedHeight}(T))\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\mathsf{Path}(T,f))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall T\">\\(\\forall T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists f\">\\(\\exists f\\)</span> 都是集合量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是数值配对编码的函数图。未量化“所有函数组成的集合”，也未引入二阶算术中不可用的第三阶对象。二叉树的每层有结点与作为结点集合无限在 RCA₀ 中等价。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.10.1; §IV.1；纸面页 36, 127；PDF 页 54, 145。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树、路径与高度谓词见 [[62-df-Tree]]，函数编码见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，$L_2=S_2$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)$ 在下式作为单个句子引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树、路径与高度谓词见 [[62-df-Tree]]，函数编码见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，$L_2=S_2$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)$ 在下式作为单个句子引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树、路径与高度谓词见 [[62-df-Tree]]，函数编码见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，$L_2=S_2$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)$ 在下式作为单个句子引入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_2=S_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WKL}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\forall T\\bigl[(\\operatorname{BinTree}(T)\\land\\mathsf{UnboundedHeight}(T))\\to\\exists f(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\\mathsf{Path}(T,f))\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall T","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，单个句子 $\\mathrm{WKL}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-WKL]]；$\\mathrm{WKL}_0$ 在 Assertion 中引入。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL|Weak König Lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["bb825000fd9a8272","c156c03daff0aff0","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}